{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792330140, "covers_from": "2026-10-18T13:29:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-18T13:30:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792330200, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-18T13:28:49+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 67176, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "教育", "content": "期盼116學年度國小每班班級人數降至25人，特教師生比落實1:10，退休教師人數立即計入當年度員額", "display_name": "士林代表 Vanessa", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T13:29:04+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "queue_number": 67177, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "里長沒有發揮作用，只努力協助黨綁樁。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.67,177", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T13:29:10+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 67178, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "育兒", "content": "附近抽菸人很多，帶著嬰幼兒在小巷遇到很難繞開。也常在超商外或公園外應該禁菸的地方遇到，怕衝突很難檢舉", "display_name": "中正代表 No.67,178", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T13:29:25+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 67179, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "公館圓環拆除後，基隆路很危險，汽車與機車亂流，路上也常看到車禍。永和到台北汽機車，車流依舊龐大無紓解", "display_name": "大安代表 No.67,179", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T13:29:40+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 67180, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "行人安全很重要，但交通規劃也應兼顧車流效率。希望能重新檢視各路口的號誌秒數，依實際人車流量做合理調整", "display_name": "中正代表 江晏華", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T13:29:55+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 67181, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "醫療", "content": "必須立法嚴格禁止中國人來台灣做醫療人士的工作，藍白想要洗中國醫護人員來台灣執業，器官被強摘穩死的", "display_name": "士林代表 No.67,181", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 67177, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture